# west (balanced) is pending. leftshoulder (LCtrl), north and south go
# down; leftshoulder's release makes west a hold. Replaying the buffer
# presses LCtrl, then stops at north's pending gesture with south's press
# and leftshoulder's release still in the buffer (MAP-09).
+west@0 +leftshoulder@10 +north@20 +south@25 -leftshoulder@28
# south's release makes north a hold; the buffer replays in order.
-south@40 -north@50 -west@60
